use href="/icons/sprites.svg#globe-01"></use></svg><span class="text-sm hidden min-[1390px]:inline">English</span></div></button></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg xl:flex-row xl:border-0"><div class="hidden xl:flex"><a href="https://app.heygen.com/login" target=""><button class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] text-neutral-black bg-gray-400 disabled:bg-gray-400 hover:text-brand-800 active:text-brand-900 disabled:text-gray-700 disabled:pointer-events-none px-5 py-3"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-sm">Login</span></button></a></div><div class="visible xl:flex"><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] text-neutral-white bg-neutral-black hover:bg-brand-main active:bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:pointer-events-none px-5 py-3"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-sm">Sign up for free</span></button></a></div><div class="flex xl:hidden"><button data-collapse-toggle="mega-menu-full" type="button" class="relative mt-2 ml-1 p-3 outline-none xl:hidden" aria-controls="mega-menu-full" aria-expanded="false"><span class="sr-only">Open main menu</span><span class="block absolute h-[2px] w-full left-0 duration-300 ease-in-out top-0 rotate-0 bg-neutral-black"></span><span class="block absolute h-[2px] w-full duration-300 ease-in-out top-[6px] left-0 opacity-1 bg-neutral-black"></span><span class="block absolute h-[2px] w-full left-0 duration-300 ease-in-out top-[12px] rotate-0 bg-neutral-black"></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is HeyGen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"HeyGen is an AI video generator that let users to create high-quality videos effortlessly. From lifelike AI avatars to multilingual voice cloning, HeyGen empowers businesses and creators to scale content production with ease.\n\nRecognized as G2’s #1 Fastest Growing Product, HeyGen is reinventing video creation for marketing, sales, and training"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is an AI video generator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An AI video generator is a tool that uses artificial intelligence for creating videos from text, images, or audio. It allows users to quickly produce high-quality videos, such as adding voices or creating animated characters, without the need for advanced video editing skills. These tools are helping everyone, from individual creators to big corporations, to produce professional videos quickly and efficiently."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How to create an AI video of yourself ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Log in to HeyGen, upload a clear photo to create your avatar, and write your script. Choose a voice, customize the video with images or music, then generate and download it as a talking photo or full video."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is HeyGen a free AI video generator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. HeyGen’s free plan offers basic tools for text to video, AI subtitle generator, and AI avatar video creation. For advanced features like AI dubbing, video from prompt, and multilingual generation, upgrade to a premium plan"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does HeyGens AI video generator cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free Plan: Up to 3 videos/month Creator Plan: $29/month Team Plan: $39/seat/month Enterprise Plans: Custom All plans include access to AI scene generator, AI-based video automation, realistic AI voiceover generator, and video auto editor. View all plans and pricing \n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best AI video generator in 2025?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"HeyGen is one of the best AI video generators in 2025. It supports AI UGC video generation, explainer video generator, AI marketing video, product demos, tutorials, and onboarding videos. It also offers AI-powered storytelling, prompt-to-video tools, and support for multiple accents. \n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does an AI video generator work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI video generators use artificial intelligence to convert text into engaging video content. They apply deep learning models to generate realistic visuals, automate voiceovers, and synchronize motion, making video creation fast and effortless. HeyGen also support image to video capabilities, allowing users to animate static visuals with ease."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I convert audio to video with HeyGen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can convert audio to video with HeyGen. Just upload or record your voice, pick a talking photo avatar, and HeyGen will sync the lip movements, expressions, and visuals for you. You can add captions, auto-generate scenes, and even use Hollywood-style voiceovers from your audio. It’s a fast, easy way to create high-quality videos without editing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use text to video for business presentations?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Text to video AI allows businesses to turn scripts into professional presentations. It is ideal for training materials, product demos, and explainer videos without requiring filming equipment or a production team."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the benefits of AI-powered video translation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI video translation expands content reach by automatically converting videos into multiple languages while preserving voice synchronization. It is widely used in global marketing, e-learning, and content localization."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can AI-generated videos replace traditional video production?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI-generated videos significantly reduce production time and costs, making content creation more efficient. While they may not fully replace high-budget film productions, they are an excellent alternative for marketing, training, and social media content."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AI video generation secure and ethical?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Leading AI video platforms prioritize security, ensuring that avatars and generated content comply with ethical guidelines. Transparency, user consent, and responsible AI development are key factors in maintaining ethical AI video generation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Face Swap feature in HeyGen’s AI Video Generator?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Face Swap AI in HeyGen’s AI Video Generator lets you replace the presenter’s face in an AI generated video with another face, such as your own, a teammate’s, or a custom avatar. This adds a personal touch to your videos while keeping the voice, gestures, and lip-sync accurately matched."}}]}</script><div class="flex flex-col"><div style="background-color:#fbfaf9" data-page-slug="/"><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-0 pb-0 lg:pb-0 hidden lg:block"><div class="relative"><div class="font-favorit h-auto lg:min-h-[600px] xl:min-h-[800px] 2xl:min-h-[calc(100vh-160px)] relative bg-[#fdfbfb] transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out"><div class="relative z-20 w-full max-md:translate-y-48 max-md:-mt-48 max-md:pt-4 max-md:bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-transparent md:absolute h-full transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out"><div class="flex justify-center h-full w-full flex-col gap-4 md:max-w-480 px-4 xl:ml-24"><h1 class="mb-0 font-favorit text-[2.3vw] leading-[2.3vw] -tracking-[0.74px] font-bold max-lg:justify-center text-neutral-black"><p><span class="gradient-text">AI Video Generator</span>: Create Talking Videos with AI</p></h1><div class="text-gray-800 lg:max-w-80 2xl:max-w-full my-6 text-lg tracking-lg 2xl:text-xl 2xl:tracking-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-favorit"><p><strong class="font-medium">Fast, simple, and incredibly powerful. </strong><br/>Start with a text, image, or audio clip. Then, our AI video generator creates the entire video for you, complete with voiceovers, translations, and styles that match your brand.</p></div><div><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button aria-label="Get Started for Free" style="background-color:#7559FF" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] bg-center bg-button-gradient text-neutral-white hover:bg-none active:!bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:bg-none disabled:pointer-events-none px-5 py-4 mt-auto"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-base"><svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="watch-video" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#watch-video"></use></svg>Get Started for Free</span></button></a></div></div></div><div class="md:absolute inset-0"><div class="overflow-hidden relative max-h-vh w-auto object-cover rounded-none lg:max-3xl:[&amp;&gt;video]:object-left md:max-lg:[&amp;&gt;video]:object-[20%_0%] retina-video-component"><img alt="video thumbnail" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FHeroEnglish2.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3FupdatedAt%3D1745968087303&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FHeroEnglish2.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3Fupdate