black lg:max-w-480"><p>From Text to Video with AI</p></h3><div class="text-gray-800 text-base lg:max-w-480 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2.5"><p>Produce complete videos with just a script and <a target="_blank" class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="https://www.heygen.com/tool/text-to-video">text to video AI</a>. Our AI video generator automates and edits the entire process and saves hours of production time. Generate a high-quality video (1080p or 4K) with a voiceover, visuals, and AI avatar. </p><p>Use it to create content faster for product explainers, sales pitches, onboarding videos, or YouTube. Match your message and audience with different voice styles, languages, and avatars.</p><p><br/></p></div><div class=""><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button aria-label="Get Started for Free" style="background-color:#7559FF" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] bg-center bg-button-gradient text-neutral-white hover:bg-none active:!bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:bg-none disabled:pointer-events-none px-6 py-[18px]"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-base"><svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="play-fill" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#play-fill"></use></svg>Get Started For Free</span></button></a></div></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2"><div class="group relative w-full h-full"><img alt="a phone screen shows a drawing of a woman and says input your script here" width="1536" height="865" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="placeholder-image size-full w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-xl opacity-100" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpdhqcmb1%2Fproduction%2F63f55d2bf6aae5f837a0cb46ea41ce5082ce9621-1536x865.heif%3Frect%3D0%2C24%2C1536%2C819%26w%3D15%26h%3D8%26fit%3Dcrop%