flex flex-col gap-6 px-8 py-10"><div class="flex gap-2.5 items-center"></div><div class="text-neutral-black"><p>Speak 175+ languages and dialects with a click. Upload a video and HeyGen’s <a target="_blank" class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="https://www.heygen.com/translate">AI video translator</a> will translate into another language with natural lip-sync and subtitles that maintains the voice, tone, and pacing of the original speaker. No need to re-record, hire voice actors, or manually sync audio. Just speed, accuracy, and content consistency across any market, in any language.</p><p><br/></p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 px-8 py-10"><div class="flex gap-2.5 items-center"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-0 pb-0 lg:pb-0 overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="container"><div class="w-full overflow-hidden relative max-h-vh rounded-5xl object-cover aspect-video"><img alt="video thumbnail" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="absolute inset-0" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FTranslateExampleEnglish-COMP.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3FupdatedAt%3D1742903642932&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FTranslateExampleEnglish-COMP.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3FupdatedAt%3D1742903642932&amp;w=375&amp;q=75 375w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FTranslateExampleEnglish-COMP.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3FupdatedAt%3D1742903642932&amp;w=414&amp;q=75 414w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FTranslateExampleEnglish-COMP.mp4%2Fik-thumbnail.jpg%3FupdatedAt%3D1742903642932&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdynamic.heygen.ai%2Fwww%2FHome%2520-%2520Page%2FTransl