ity.io/images/pdhqcmb1/production/23551ea3ecb8212ea64ac79259301d9e4cd5863f-600x69.svg?w=600&amp;h=69&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format"/></div><div class="text-base tracking-base leading-normal text-gray-800"><p>“HeyGen has revolutionized the way we create video content and has helped use video as a form of communication...it has made communication much more accessible and much more personal.”</p><p class="mt-7 font-medium">Andreas Henschel, Group Leader in Corporate Communications</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/customer-stories/wurth-group"><button class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center bg-transparent relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] w-fit gradient-text disabled:bg-transparent disabled:text-gray-600 disabled:pointer-events-none pr-5 py-1 mt-auto"><span class="flex size-full items-center font-favorit justify-center gap-2 text-base">Read Würth Group&#x27;s Full Case Study<svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="arrow-narrow-right" class="transition-transform group-hover:-rotate-45 text-brand-main" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#arrow-narrow-right"></use></svg></span></button></a></div></div></section><div class="container"><hr class="h-[1px] w-full border-neutral-line"/></div></div></div><div class="relative pt-20 lg:pt-40 pb-0 lg:pb-40 overflow-hidden" style="background-color:rgba(20, 20, 20, 1.00)"><div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-visible"><div class="relative flex w-full h-full items-center justify-center"><div class="absolute top-0 h-[15rem] w-[50%] text-white right-1/2" style="background-image:conic-gradient(from 70deg at center top, #7559FF4D, transparent 40%, transparent);opacity:0.5;max-width:20rem"><div style="background-color:rgba(20, 20, 20, 1.00)" class="absolute w-[100%] left-0 h-40 bottom-0 z-20 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_top,white,transparent)]"></div><div style="background-colo