deos into different languages, add voiceovers that match your brand, and speed up your entire content creation process; all with simple, smart AI tools.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3 w-fit flex-wrap ml-0 lg:ml-auto sm:self-end"><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button aria-label="Get Started for Free" style="background-color:#7559FF" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] bg-center bg-button-gradient text-neutral-white hover:bg-none active:!bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:bg-none disabled:pointer-events-none px-6 py-[18px]"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-base"><svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="play-fill" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#play-fill"></use></svg>Get Started For Free</span></button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-16 pb-8 lg:pb-16"><div class="relative"><div class="container grid w-full grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2" style="gap:18px"><div class="flex flex-col rounded-5xl h-full overflow-hidden relative lg:flex-row lg:max-h-[480px] lg:col-span-2" style="background-color:rgba(33, 33, 33, 1.00)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 px-10 pt-10 pb-12 lg:w-1/2 lg:justify-between" style="background-color:transparent;--card-bg:rgba(33, 33, 33, 1.00)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 z-10"><h4 class="mb-0 font-favorit text-xl tracking-xl font-medium max-lg:justify-center text-neutral-white"><p>Templates that Don&#x27;t Feel Like Templates</p></h4></div><div class="z-10 text-neutral-white"><p>Skip the cookie-cutter approach. Our fully customizable templates adapt to your unique brand style, making it easy to create compelling marketing clips, training modules, and product demos. Stand out from the crowd with polished videos that look and feel like they were made just for you.<