class="flex flex-col gap-8 px-10 pt-10 pb-12" style="background-color:transparent;--card-bg:rgba(33, 33, 33, 1.00)"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 z-10"><h4 class="mb-0 font-favorit text-xl tracking-xl font-medium max-lg:justify-center text-neutral-white"><p>Integrate HeyGen</p></h4></div><div class="z-10 text-neutral-white"><p>Streamline your workflow and eliminate tedious manual tasks. Our API lets you automate video production, convert speech to multiple languages, and generate lifelike voiceovers with minimal effort. Focus on crafting powerful stories while we handle the heavy lifting behind the scenes.</p></div></div><div class="relative h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] overflow-hidden mt-auto lg:h-[655px]"><div class="group relative w-full h-full"><img alt="alt" width="1500" height="1600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="placeholder-image size-full h-full w-full object-cover opacity-100" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpdhqcmb1%2Fproduction%2F02019a631487df5a934f9c1880f2b5b66ecfb3eb-1500x1600.png%3Fw%3D15%26h%3D16%26fit%3Dcrop%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpdhqcmb1%2Fproduction%2F02019a631487df5a934f9c1880f2b5b66ecfb3eb-1500x1600.png%3Fw%3D15%26h%3D16%26fit%3Dcrop%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=1536&amp;q=75"/><img alt="alt" loading="lazy" width="1500" height="1600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="full-image absolute size-full top-0 left-0 transition-opacity duration-200 opacity-0 h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpdhqcmb1%2Fproduction%2F02019a631487df5a934f9c1880f2b5b66ecfb3eb-1500x1600.png%3Fw%3D1500%26h%3D1600%26fit%3Dcrop%26auto%3Dformat&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpdhqcmb1%2Fproduction%2F02019a631487df5a934f9c1880f2b5b66ecfb3eb-1500x1600.png%3Fw%3D1500%26h%3D1600