"text-neutral-white">Ethical</span> <span class="gradient-text">AI video maker</span>, <span class="text-neutral-white">built to protect your data</span></p></h3><div class="text-gray-800 my-6 text-xl tracking-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-favorit max-w-480"><p>We believe ethical AI means putting user safety and data protection first. We embed privacy, transparency, and accountability into our technology and policies, ensuring your data is safeguarded at every step. That’s why our infrastructure is certified to meet global security and compliance standards. By designing AI that respects user rights and prevents misuse, we make visual storytelling accessible, secure, and ethical for all.</p><p><br/></p></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 mx-auto flex-wrap lg:mx-0"><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button aria-label="Get Started for Free" style="background-color:#7559FF" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] bg-center bg-button-gradient text-neutral-white hover:bg-none active:!bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:bg-none disabled:pointer-events-none px-6 py-[18px] mt-auto"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-base"><svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="play-fill" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#play-fill"></use></svg>Get Started For Free</span></button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-0 pb-0 lg:pb-0"><div class="relative"><div class="relative pt-16 lg:pt-28 pb-16 lg:pb-28" style="background-color:rgba(241, 245, 247, 1.00)"><div class="relative"><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-0 pb-16 lg:pb-16"><div class="relative"><div class="container"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row"><div class="w-full max-w-480 xl:max-w-640 font-favorit"><div class="mb-4 flex flex