t-4xl font-medium text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">Have questions? We have answers</h2><div class="border-t border-neutral-line"><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>What is HeyGen?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>HeyGen is an AI video generator that let users to create high-quality videos effortlessly. From lifelike AI avatars to multilingual voice cloning, HeyGen empowers businesses and creators to scale content production with ease.<br/><br/>Recognized as G2’s #1 Fastest Growing Product, HeyGen is reinventing video creation for marketing, sales, and training</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>What is an AI video generator?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>An <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/tool/ai-video-generator">AI video generator </a>is a tool that uses artificial intelligence for creating videos from text, images, or audio. It allows users to quickly produce high-quality videos, such as adding voices or creating animated characters, without the need for advanced video editing skills. These tools are helping everyone, from individual creators to big corporations, to produce professional videos quickly and efficiently.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>How to create an AI video of yourself ?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Log in to HeyGen, upload a clear photo to create your avatar, and write your script. Choose a voice, customize the video with images or music, then generate and download it as a <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/avatars/ai-photo-avatar">talking photo</a> or full video.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>Is HeyGen a free AI video generator?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Yes. HeyGen’s free plan offers basic tools for <a target="_blank" class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="https://www.heygen.com/tool/text-to-video">text to video</a>, AI subtitle generator, and AI avatar video creation. For advanced features like AI dubbing, video from prompt, and multilingual generation, upgrade to a premium plan</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>How much does HeyGens AI video generator cost?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Free Plan: Up to 3 videos/month</p><ul><li class="mb-2 ml-5 list-disc">Creator Plan: $29/month</li><li class="mb-2 ml-5 list-disc">Team Plan: $39/seat/month</li><li class="mb-2 ml-5 list-disc">Enterprise Plans: Custom</li></ul><p>All plans include access to AI scene generator, AI-based video automation, realistic AI voiceover generator, and video auto editor. View all <a target="_blank" class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="https://www.heygen.com/pricing">plans and pricing</a></p><p><br/></p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>What is the best AI video generator in 2025?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>HeyGen is one of the best AI video generators in 2025. It supports <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/avatars/ugc">AI UGC</a> video generation, explainer video generator, AI marketing video, product demos, tutorials, and onboarding videos. It also offers AI-powered storytelling, prompt-to-video tools, and support for multiple accents.</p><p><br/></p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>How does an AI video generator work?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>AI video generators use artificial intelligence to convert text into engaging video content. They apply deep learning models to generate realistic visuals, automate voiceovers, and synchronize motion, making video creation fast and effortless. HeyGen also support <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/tool/image-to-video">image to video</a> capabilities, allowing users to animate static visuals with ease.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>Can I convert audio to video with HeyGen?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Yes, you can convert <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/tool/audio-to-video-converter">audio to video</a> with HeyGen. Just upload or record your voice, pick a talking photo avatar, and HeyGen will sync the lip movements, expressions, and visuals for you. You can add captions, auto-generate scenes, and even use Hollywood-style voiceovers from your audio. It’s a fast, easy way to create high-quality videos without editing.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>Can I use text to video for business presentations?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Absolutely. <a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/tool/text-to-video">Text to video AI</a> allows businesses to turn scripts into professional presentations. It is ideal for training materials, product demos, and explainer videos without requiring filming equipment or a production team.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>What are the benefits of AI-powered video translation?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>AI video translation expands content reach by automatically converting videos into multiple languages while preserving voice synchronization. It is widely used in global marketing, e-learning, and content localization.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>Can AI-generated videos replace traditional video production?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>AI-generated videos significantly reduce production time and costs, making content creation more efficient. While they may not fully replace high-budget film productions, they are an excellent alternative for marketing, training, and social media content.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>Is AI video generation secure and ethical?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p>Leading AI video platforms prioritize security, ensuring that avatars and generated content comply with ethical guidelines. Transparency, user consent, and responsible AI development are key factors in maintaining ethical AI video generation.</p></div></div><div class="border-b py-8 text-neutral-black border-neutral-line"><button class="w-full text-left flex gap-6 text-lg lg:text-xl transition-all" aria-expanded="false"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="transition-transform w-3 min-w-3 transform ml-1 " height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z"></path></svg><h3>What is the Face Swap feature in HeyGen’s AI Video Generator?</h3></button><div class="overflow-hidden ml-10 text-lg lg:text-xl !leading-[26px] text-gray-800" style="height:0px;opacity:0;margin-top:0px"><p><a class="text-[#498eff] hover:underline" href="/tool/face-swap-video">Face Swap AI</a> in HeyGen’s AI Video Generator lets you replace the presenter’s face in an AI generated video with another face, such as your own, a teammate’s, or a custom avatar. This adds a personal touch to your videos while keeping the voice, gestures, and lip-sync accurately matched.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class="relative pt-0 lg:pt-0 pb-0 lg:pb-0"><div class="relative"><div class="relative pt-16 lg:pt-28 pb-16 lg:pb-16" style="background-color:rgba(240, 245, 248, 1.00)"><div class="relative"><div class="container"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row"><div class="w-full max-w-480 xl:max-w-640 font-favorit"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-row"><span class="mb-0 font-favorit text-lg tracking-lg font-medium max-lg:justify-center flex items-center gap-2 [&amp;_*]:!leading-normal"><div class="relative rounded-full w-3 h-3 bg-brand-main/15 before:absolute before:top-1/2 before:left-1/2 before:-translate-x-1/2 before:-translate-y-1/2 before:w-2 before:h-2 before:rounded-full before:bg-brand-main"></div><p><span class="text-gray-800 opacity-64">Testimonials</span></p></span></div><h2 class="mb-0 font-favorit text-3xl tracking-4xl lg:text-4xl font-medium max-lg:justify-center text-neutral-black"><p><span class="gradient-text">What Customers Say About Us</span></p></h2></div><div class="flex gap-3 w-fit flex-wrap ml-0 lg:ml-auto sm:self-end"><a href="https://app.heygen.com/signup" target=""><button aria-label="Get Started for Free" style="background-color:#7559FF" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center rounded-full relative gap-2 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-[0.3s] bg-center bg-button-gradient text-neutral-white hover:bg-none active:!bg-brand-900 disabled:text-neutral-white disabled:bg-gray-700 disabled:bg-none disabled:pointer-events-none px-6 py-[18px]"><span class="flex font-favorit size-full w-max items-center justify-center gap-2 !leading-none text-base"><svg width="16" height="16" role="img" aria-label="play-fill" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/sprites.svg#play-fill"></use></svg>Get Started For Free</span></button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative p